BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Heavy Boardgamers
UID:event_314885459@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260608T044156Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T230000
SUMMARY:Toronto Downtown Bi-Weekly Friday Night Gaming @ Wild Wings Bar & 
 Grill
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Heavy Boardgamers\nWelcome to the Friday Night Gaming 
 meetup for Toronto Heavy Boardgamers @ Wild Wings Bar & Grill!\n\nThe purp
 ose of this event is to meet up to play board and card games of all types\
 , from party / light games through to heavier / longer board games\, and h
 ave fun while doing it! Gamers of all levels of experience are welcome!\n\
 nYou are welcome to bring your own games to the event\, or join games host
 ed by others. The venue is looking to set up its own library soon\, so mor
 e options will be available then.\n\n**Scheduling details:**\n\n\\- If you
  have a specific game that you would like to post for\\\, feel free to do 
 so in comments\\.\n\n\\- If you would like to join a specific game that ha
 s already been posted\\\, feel free to comment on it confirming your parti
 cipation\\. Make sure you have noted the details posted by the host\\.\n\n
 \\- You are of course also welcome to organize / join games onsite on the 
 day itself\\\, assuming sufficient players / tables are available\n\n**Ava
 ilable Amenities:**\n\n\\- Food and drinks are available on\\-site\\. **Ou
 tside food and drinks are not allowed.**\n\n**Admission Fee:**\n\n\\- Ther
 e is a minimum spend /fee of $15\\.00 \\(\\+tax\\) charged by the establis
 hment for use of space\\. So if you purchase food and drinks for $15 or mo
 re\\\, you only have to pay for the food/drinks and there will be no table
  fee for you\\. However\\\, if you order nothing\\\, or less then $15\\\, 
 expect to be charged the minimum $15 spend limit\\.\n\n\\- Payments are to
  be made directly to the establishment during the event and not to the org
 anizer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-heavy-boardgamers/events/3148
 85459/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260521T012936Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260521T012936Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
